  abilityDesc: 15 combo Earth attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    may activate BB/SBB/UBB twice for 3 turns, restores HP, fills OD gauge at turn's
    end for 3 turns, boosts OD gauge fill rate for 3 turns & may raise allies from
    KO
